{"channelId":"UCe02xV6eckK950QuhBycLMw","row":["Mel Cash",2820,"Mel is recognised as one of the pioneers of massage over the last 25 years and has published several international textbooks on the subject. He has gained the most extensive clinical experience having worked with World class athletes and dancers (including the Royal Ballet in London and the Tokyo Ballet in Japan) as well as people with serious medical conditions. \n\nHe is a passionate and inspiring teacher who has also presented workshops Internationally. He used to compete at a high amateur level in Marathons and Triathlons. He has written a number of books including Sport & Remedial Massage Therapy and Advanced Remedial Massage and Soft Tissue Therapy and is regarded as one of the world’s leading authorities on the subject.\n\nMel Cash (Principal Tutor at LSSM) Therapist since 1985 Tutor since 1989","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe02xV6eckK950QuhBycLMw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe02xV6eckK950QuhBycLMw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:56.767Z","channelId":"UCe02xV6eckK950QuhBycLMw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"78eeef1eb4834c7b4c936c7a822edf946f0acdba32ebdb2f08aeb27969f9840e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"9a319ef46eec8245f14e57c4335dd4eecae973e7e9aefd710cbedb63e38889ce"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe02xV6eckK950QuhBycLMw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:56.767Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe02xV6eckK950QuhBycLMw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2820,"raw":"2.82K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe02xV6eckK950QuhBycLMw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:56.767Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":